<title>BELGIUM: IBt expects to win U.S. patent.</title>
<headline>IBt expects to win U.S. patent.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's International Brachytherapy SA (IBt) said the U.S. Patent and Trademark Office had told it it intended to award it, after examination, the patent for hollow-tube-shaped Palladium-103 seed-substrate.</p>
<p>Ibt said the news came earlier than expected.</p>
<p>IBt, specialised in the production of implants used in prostate cancer treatment, recently opened an industrial unit in Atlanta, Georgia, to distribute medical implants in north America.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
